        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kim Dong-wook, Kim Dae-seung, Jeong Yu-mi, Oh Ji-ho, Lee Si-a, Jeon So-min, Lee Yi-kyung\n- Works: Happy Killers, Romantic Heaven, The Concubine, Maids\n- Topics: South Korean film, South Korean television\n\nFacts:\n- Kim Dong-wook starred in the film \"Happy Killers\" in 2010.\n- Kim Dong-wook starred in the film \"Romantic Heaven\" in 2011.\n- \"The Concubine\" is a 2012 South Korean historical film directed by Kim Dae-seung.\n- In 2012, Kim Dong-wook received the best reviews of his career for playing an obsessed and tormented king in the period drama film \"The Concubine.\"\n- \"Maids\" is a 2015 South Korean television series starring Jeong Yu-mi, Oh Ji-ho, Kim Dong-wook, Lee Si-a, Jeon So-min, and Lee Yi-kyung.",
